<group prefix="WebGpuSharp.">
	<comment location="AddressMode">
		<summary>
			describes the behavior of the sampler if the sampled texels extend beyond the
			bounds of the sampled texture.
		</summary>
	</comment>
	<group prefix="AddressMode.">
		<comment location="Undefined">
			<summary>No address mode is specified. (uses default address mode)</summary>
		</comment>
	</group>
</group>